    "Boxes is simple and easy to follow. Every word sits in one of five boxes. Know it, and it moves up and waits longer. Miss it, and it starts again. Smart (Beta) watches your own answers and works out how fast you forget each word, then brings it back just before that. For many people this means fewer reviews for the same result. Your boxes and dates don't change when you switch, and you can switch back at any time. Each notebook has its own choice.",
